<title>USA: Hussey Copper raises copper value to 123.00 cents.</title>
<headline>Hussey Copper raises copper value to 123.00 cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd. adjusted its prices  to reflect contained copper at 123.00 cents a lb, down 2 cents, effective  Aug. 1.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1646))</p>
